OriginBA Stable v15 Filter/Icon Fix

This build is based on the uploaded OriginBA_Stable_v15 theme.
Only filter/icon-safety changes were made:
- Removed the broad .jr font override that could clobber Jasper icon fonts.
- Restored Jasper icons/operators font usage for Ad Hoc, filters, toolbars, and designer icons.
- Did not change the v15 branding, colors, layout, login, search, or repository styling.

Import as a new root-level theme name, for example OriginBA_Stable_v15_FilterIconFix.
